      },
      {
        "level": "error",
        "type": "structure",
        "location": "layout.sections[1].body.children",
        "message": "chart-y-axis和chart-x-axis作为独立children平铺在body中，但折线图主体chart-main已是独立节点，坐标轴应作为chart配置的一部分而非DOM平级兄弟节点，导致父子关系语义混乱。",
        "suggestion": "将chart-y-axis、chart-x-axis、chart-warning-line、chart-y-axis-label收归chart-main的子配置，body.children只保留chart-main一个图表节点。"
      },
      {
        "level": "warning",
